Answer:

	Latest Snapshot
	      ↓
	Create Volume
	      ↓
	Attach
	      ↓
	Mount
	      ↓
	Copy Required Files


33. How do you migrate data between EC2 instances?

	Method 1: Snapshot

	Volume
	  ↓
	Snapshot
	  ↓
	New Volume
	  ↓
	Attach to New EC2

	Method 2: rsync

